    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "dsh-requirements-alignment is a lightweight runtime drift guard for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). It turns the user's intent into a durable requirement baseline, stays out of the way while the agent works, and only interrupts when the next step would materially change the direction."
